{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415803","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415803","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041580301:1":{"text":"おお！その格好、「ゴーストハウス」のキャストにぴったりですね！","source_cn":"哇！你这个造型太适合“鬼影密室”了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA913D4FBE4762C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580302:1":{"text":"あなたを女将さんに紹介して、次の冬の祭典では、シロクマ温泉旅館でお化け役をやってもらうよう頼まないと！","source_cn":"我一定要把你介绍给老板娘，让她在下次冬日祭典的时候邀请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72DEF7C4FD4428A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580303:1":{"text":"冬の祭典？聞いたことがあるような……","source_cn":"冬日祭典？我好像在哪听说过这个名字……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0035351AEE94594C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580304:1":{"text":"ああ、思い出した。ホワイトマウンテン公国の冬の祭典か。","source_cn":"……啊，想起来了。你说的是白山公国的冬日祭典吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC1EB3E550EC4CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580305:1":{"text":"そうです！スノーシダー町のお祭りですよ。ユグドラシルにもああいう面白い催しものがあればいいんですけどねえ。","source_cn":"是啊！就在白山公国的雪松镇上。薄暮丛林可没有这么有趣的节日。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FE6238F963883E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580306:1":{"text":"あれ？よく見たら……あなた、生前はブライトの方ですか？","source_cn":"这样说来，仔细一看……你生前是耀光人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6CA02C32BF3F85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580307:1":{"text":"ああ、俺はブライトの人間だ。今は……ブライトの亡霊ってところかな。","source_cn":"对，我是耀光人，不过现在应该算是耀光的鬼了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F65956AF61324C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580308:1":{"text":"俺の故郷は国境にあって、ずっと情勢が不安定だったから、あまり遠出する機会がなくてな。だから、ホワイトマウンテンには行ったことがないんだ。","source_cn":"可惜我的家乡地处边境，一直动荡不安，我没有太多机会远行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CB974374FE7349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580309:1":{"text":"だったら、ぜひ一度行ってみるべきですよ！あそこはブライトで一番グレイヴボーンに友好的な場所で――あ、決して他の人たちが敵視しているという意味ではなくて……","source_cn":"那你真的应该去看看！我觉得那里应该是耀光帝国对亡灵最友...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF188316FD39B3DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580310:1":{"text":"ははっ、大丈夫だ。君の言いたいことは分かっている。","source_cn":"哈哈，不用这么紧张，我明白你的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89CE840C63537C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580311:1":{"text":"ブライト人の多くがグレイヴボーンに敵意を持っているのは事実だ。俺や俺の家族、友人もそうだったからな。","source_cn":"而且很多耀光人确实很敌视亡灵，这是事实。我和我的家人朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47B8B902D1ACEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580312:1":{"text":"実際にバンティスへ行って、この目で見ていなければ、今もそれは変わっていなかったかもしれない。","source_cn":"要不是亲自去了一趟班题斯，可能我们的想法永远都不会改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2F36EB7A1BF7A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580313:1":{"text":"バンティスに行ったことがあるんですか！？","source_cn":"你竟然还去过班题斯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEDD0FDB53A45AD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580314:1":{"text":"ああ、俺はそこでグレイヴボーンに転化させられたんだ。","source_cn":"是啊，我就是在那里被转化成亡灵的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFFD9FE91087365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580315:1":{"text":"転化！？なんだか不穏な響きですね……","source_cn":"转化？！这听起来可不太妙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A8E9726E4DC5EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041580316:1":{"text":"そうだな。肉体の死や魂が引き裂かれる感覚は、あまりいいものじゃない。","source_cn":"是啊，无论是肉体死亡还是灵魂被撕裂的感受，都不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B79D2910DE3E160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041580317:1":{"text":"もうやめよう。今はもっと楽しい話をしようじゃないか。","source_cn":"好了，别说这些了，还是来聊些高兴的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBA3900A317506A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041580318:1":{"text":"ホワイトマウンテン公国や冬の祭典について教えてくれないか？行く機会があれば、家族や親友を連れて見に行ってみたい。","source_cn":"能多给我讲讲有关白山公国和冬日祭典的事吗？如果将来有机...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF058F8EE2C48B427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴登":{"text":"バートン","source":"巴登","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}